{"accountName": "深信服千里目安全实验室", "author": "深信服千里目安全实验室", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "深瞳漏洞实验室 2026-11-25 17:18 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年11月24日，深瞳漏洞实验室监测到一则Microsoft Windows组件存在权限提升漏洞的信息，漏洞编号：CVE-2026-119853，漏洞威胁等级：高危。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/APc6NwjLsxTtJcica6DXz7eqZM6icUIklK6xTpgjYR3MHsSwV7fr7meWykaZTzx0DUcOLA4YBrL2sLV5zevbSib4pia3X56ibibcsLqda2mNpT1UQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞名称：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Microsoft Windows 远程访问 API 自定义拨号器本地权限提升漏洞（CVE-2026-119853）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "组件名称：", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/APc6NwjLsxQ6omloVuhbmFpEhAlc72ic7RYZFKTMib6hiatn42JRvWIFwfeHGsgicQ67ZCUrFQCUib7B3rmJqkNbWsgTueDNckNmpPxAbhDPVdRs/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "Microsoft Windows", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.14393.0 <= Windows 10 Version 1607 < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/APc6NwjLsxSeKobJia5ufJQjW4XOmjea2MtBgxTicu1wzAM05qG9X72CuUEGCK7Kp6e8rebj9MJKyO2n9uryCJayqdoKGhJmFhxjBDzibECHR4/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows 10 Version 1809 < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.19044.0 <= Windows 10 Version 21H2 < 10.0.19044.7846", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.19045.0 <= Windows 10 Version 22H2 < 10.0.19045.7846", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w8NHw6tcQ5zvcIHbwGGYKbqDVYsVKzNNia1jYtHf49C7133AlDXAgex2W4lFvpia56tjQQDkiauNBrl08YbxqG01A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "10.0.22631.0 <= Windows 11 Version 23H2 < 10.0.22631.7711", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows 11 Version 24H2 < 10.0.26100.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26200.0 <= Windows 11 Version 25H2 < 10.0.26200.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.28000.0 <= Windows 11 Version 26H1 < 10.0.28000.3501", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26300.0 <= Windows 11 Version 26H2 < 10.0.26300.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.14393.0 <= Windows Server 2016 < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.14393.0 <= Windows Server 2016 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows Server 2019 < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows Server 2019 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.20348.0 <= Windows Server 2022 < 10.0.20348.5870", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows Server 2025 < 10.0.26100.33822", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows Server 2025 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.26100.33822", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞类型：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "权限提升", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1、用户认证：是", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2、前置条件：目标系统使用 2026 年 11 月累积更新之前的受影响 Windows 版本；攻击者拥有本地低权限账号，且能建立一个可成功连接的拨号/VPN 连接（如自建 PPTP 服务端）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3、触发方式：本地", "type": "p"}, {"text": "综合评价：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用难度：中等，需本地低权限账号和一个可成功建立的拨号/VPN 连接（如自建 PPTP 服务端），无需 UAC 交互，攻击复杂度低。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁等级：高危，Microsoft 评定 CVSS 3.1 基础得分 7.8（时间分 6.8），本地低权限用户可提升至 SYSTEM 权限。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "官方解决方案：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已发布", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞分析", "type": "p"}, {"text": "组件介绍", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Microsoft Windows（官方名称 Microsoft Windows，由微软公司开发的闭源桌面及服务器操作系统）是全球部署最广泛的操作系统，内置远程访问 API（rasapi32.dll）管理拨号与 VPN 连接，RasMan 服务以 LocalSystem 运行并经 netman 提供网络连接管理接口。Windows 为系统组件，随系统发行。在本次漏洞中，受影响的 Windows 版本在 RAS 挂断路径加载用户电话簿中用户可控的 CustomDialDll，导致本地低权限用户可提升至 SYSTEM 权限。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞简介", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年11月24日，深瞳漏洞实验室监测到一则Microsoft Windows组件存在权限提升漏洞的信息，漏洞编号：CVE-2026-119853，漏洞威胁等级：高危。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 远程访问 API（rasapi32.dll）存在不可信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426）。每用户电话簿 rasphone.pbk 中的 CustomDialDll 可由用户任意指定；自定义拨号器的信任校验仅在拨号阶段进行，连接建立后用户即可改写该字段。 挂断时，以 LocalSystem 运行的 RasMan 服务经 netman 调用 rasapi32!DwCustomHangUp，用 LoadLibraryExW 加载用户指定 DLL 并以 SYSTEM 权限调用其 RasCustomHangUp 导出，本地低权限用户可借此以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞验证", "type": "p"}, {"text": "使用受影响的windows环境复现该漏洞，提权至SYSTEM，效果如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前受影响的Microsoft Windows版本： 10.0.14393.0 <= Windows 10 Version 1607 < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows 10 Version 1809 < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.19044.0 <= Windows 10 Version 21H2 < 10.0.19044.7846", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.19045.0 <= Windows 10 Version 22H2 < 10.0.19045.7846", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.22631.0 <= Windows 11 Version 23H2 < 10.0.22631.7711", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows 11 Version 24H2 < 10.0.26100.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26200.0 <= Windows 11 Version 25H2 < 10.0.26200.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.28000.0 <= Windows 11 Version 26H1 < 10.0.28000.3501", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26300.0 <= Windows 11 Version 26H2 < 10.0.26300.9974", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.14393.0 <= Windows Server 2016 < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.14393.0 <= Windows Server 2016 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.14393.9688", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows Server 2019 < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.17763.0 <= Windows Server 2019 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.17763.9487", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.20348.0 <= Windows Server 2022 < 10.0.20348.5870", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows Server 2025 < 10.0.26100.33822", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10.0.26100.0 <= Windows Server 2025 (Server Core installation) < 10.0.26100.33822", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解决方案", "type": "p"}, {"text": "官方修复建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "通过Windows自动更新或手动安装补丁修复此漏洞修复方式：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "启用Windows自动更新检测并安装最新安全更新，或手动下载安装对应系统补丁", "type": "p"}, {"text": "下载链接： https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-119853", "type": "p"}, {"text": "临时修复建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "关闭未使用的功能模块，减少潜在攻击入口。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "遵循最小权限原则，严控各类敏感操作权限范围。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "非必要不暴露服务到公网，限制访问源为可信范围。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "定期更新系统及各类组件至安全版本，及时修补已知隐患。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "深信服解决方案", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞主动检测", "type": "p"}, {"text": "支持对该漏洞的主动检测， 可批量检出业务场景中该事件的受影响资产情况， 相关产品如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "【深信服统一端点安全管理系统aES】 已支持该漏洞检测。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "参考链接", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-119853", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间轴", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026/11/24", "type": "p"}, {"text": "深瞳漏洞实验室监测到Microsoft Windows 远程访问 API 自定义拨号器本地权限提升漏洞信息。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026/11/25", "type": "p"}, {"text": "深瞳漏洞实验室发布漏洞通告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击 阅读原文 ，及时关注并登录深信服 智安全平台 ，可轻松查询漏洞相关解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/APc6NwjLsxTtJcica6DXz7eqZM6icUIklK6xTpgjYR3MHsSwV7fr7meWykaZTzx0DUcOLA4YBrL2sLV5zevbSib4pia3X56ibibcsLqda2mNpT1UQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月25日", "id": "1641640857", "summary": "深瞳漏洞实验室 2026-11-25 17:18 北京 \n2026年11月24日，深瞳漏洞实验室监测到一则Microsoft Windows组件存在权限提升漏洞的信息，漏洞编号：CVE-2026-119853，漏洞威胁等级：高危。\n漏洞名称： \nMicrosoft Windows 远程访问 API 自定义拨号器本地权限提升漏洞（CVE-2026-119853） \n组件名称： \nMicrosoft ", "title": "【漏洞通告】Microsoft Windows 远程访问 API 自定义拨号器本地权限提升漏洞（CVE-2026-119853）", "ts": 1795598280000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526564&idx=2&sn=5a244b62d3003fe55601fe08be69ccaf"}